<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{index .Data "name"}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{if eq (index .Data "change") "retired"}}A Koro collection account was retired; new payment instructions no longer show it.{{else}}Koro's default collection account changed; new payment instructions show this IBAN.{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Account: {{index .Data "label"}}<br>IBAN: {{index .Data "iban_masked"}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If you did not expect this change, tell Koro support at once.</p>
